  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-334-348">いとしや</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-348-362">いとしや</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-362-394">この身の影に鳴く蟲の</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-394-435">ねんねんころりと鳴きにけり</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-435-456">たれに抱かれて</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-462-510"><lem><seg source="#source-456-462">寢る</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-498-504">寝る</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-510-521">身ぞや</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-521-550">眞實我身は獨りもの</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-550-576">三十になるといふ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-576-602">その事の寂しさよ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-602-637">勘平さんにはあらねども</seg></p>
      <p><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-637-685"><seg source="#source-637-649">せつぷく</seg></hi><seg source="#source-685-711">しても果つべきか</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-711-738">ても因業なくつわ蟲</seg></p>
    </body>
